      "updated": 1786053849223,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Black line means the next step is just a view of the prior\nRed line means there is a PUT (new state). These right now are coordinated by temporal fetchers flow (event-driven queue)\nGreen lines are sources of truth external to the system ",
