      "text": "Follow ups\n1. canonical.ad_spend_daily instead of canonical-sstatic\nCleaner final design is a boost-owned spend relation built from stable ad ownership, rather then depending on old canonical pipeline.\n\nRevenue has a proven advertiser and ad ID, but there is no physical spend row for that same ad on the revenue's event date.",
