      "updated": 1789743509334,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now each (revenue,day) also has following\ncustody_type (wayward vs customer account)\ncommission_recipient_account_id\nprovider_gross_commission_amount\nprovider_direct_creator_amount\nwayward_collected_amount\nbrand_funded_creator_amount\ncreator_passthrough_amount\nwayward_network_fee_amount\ntotal_creator_earnings\nbrand_commission_policy_id + rate\ncreator_passthrough_policy_id + rate\ncommercial-status and hold_reason\n\nretailer (Wayward definition)\nid_from_affiliate network + affiliate_network\n\n\ncredential_id\nThis our \"house / wayward account\", \n",
